{"headword":"קֶ֫רֶן","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.25\">Je 48:25</a> horn;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.1\">Is 5:1</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">קָ֑רֶן</span>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:5\" href=\"/Psalms.75.5\">ψ 75:5</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶ֫רֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:5\" href=\"/Joshua.6.5\">Jos 6:5</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.1\">1 S 2:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:11\" href=\"/Psalms.92.11\">ψ 92:11</a>, etc.; du. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:4\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.4\">Hb 3:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קְרָנַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:3\" href=\"/Daniel.8.3\">Dn 8:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:6\" href=\"/Daniel.8.6\">6</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">נָ֑יִם</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:3\" href=\"/Daniel.8.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:20\" href=\"/Daniel.8.20\">20</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנֵי</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:11\" href=\"/Psalms.75.11\">ψ 75:11</a>, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 22:13\" href=\"/Genesis.22.13\">Gn 22:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.17\">Dt 33:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קְרָנָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:7\" href=\"/Daniel.8.7\">Dn 8:7</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.21\">Ez 34:21</a>; pl. (usually in der. senses) <span dir=\"rtl\">קְרָנוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.15\">Ez 43:15</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:12\" href=\"/Exodus.29.12\">Ex 29:12</a> +, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:2\" href=\"/Exodus.27.2\">27:2</a> +, etc.;—<em>horn:</em>"},{"senses":[{"senses":[{"definition":"of ram <span dir=\"rtl\">(אַיִל)</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 22:13\" href=\"/Genesis.22.13\">Gn 22:13</a>, so in Daniel’s vision <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:3\" href=\"/Daniel.8.3\">Dn 8:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:6\" href=\"/Daniel.8.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:7\" href=\"/Daniel.8.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:20\" href=\"/Daniel.8.20\">20</a>, and (of goat) v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:5\" href=\"/Daniel.8.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:8\" href=\"/Daniel.8.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:9\" href=\"/Daniel.8.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:21\" href=\"/Daniel.8.21\">21</a>; of oppressors in Isr. (under fig. of rams) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.21\">Ez 34:21</a>, so of nations <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 2:2\" href=\"/Zechariah.2.2\">Zc 2:2</a><sup>(×3)</sup>; of <span dir=\"rtl\">רְאֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.17\">Dt 33:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 22:22\" href=\"/Psalms.22.22\">ψ 22:22</a> (both fig., cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:11\" href=\"/Psalms.92.11\">92:11</a>); of Zion under fig. of threshing-ox <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:13\" href=\"/Micah.4.13\">Mi 4:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ בַּרְזֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 22:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.22.11\">1 K 22:11</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 18:10\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.18.10\">2 Ch 18:10</a> (symbol.); seen in Zech.’s vision <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 2:1\" href=\"/Zechariah.2.1\">Zc 2:1</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"used as oil-flask <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.1\">1 S 16:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.13\">13</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:39\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.39\">1 K 1:39</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, קֶרֶן הַפּוּךְ\" href=\"/BDB,_קֶרֶן הַפּוּךְ\", dir=\"rtl\">קֶרֶן הַפּוּךְ</a> Infr.)."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ הַיּוֹבֵל</span>, as wind-instr. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 6:5\" href=\"/Joshua.6.5\">Jos 6:5</a> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוֹפָר</span>)."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנוֹת שֵׁן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.15\">Ez 27:15</a> (from curved shape of tusks)."}],"num":"d."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"fig., of pers., symbl of strength <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.17\">Dt 33:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ יִשְׁעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.3\">2 S 22:3</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:3\" href=\"/Psalms.18.3\">ψ 18:3</a> (of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> as deliverer); others sub <strong>3</strong> or <strong>4</strong>; especially as lifted up (<span dir=\"rtl\">רום</span>, as of a lordly animal, cf. Dr <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.1\">1 S 2:1</a>), denoting increase of might, dignity <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.1\">1 S 2:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.10\">10</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:17\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.17\">La 2:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:11\" href=\"/Psalms.75.11\">ψ 75:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:18\" href=\"/Psalms.89.18\">89:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:25\" href=\"/Psalms.89.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 92:11\" href=\"/Psalms.92.11\">92:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 112:9\" href=\"/Psalms.112.9\">112:9</a>, so perhaps <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.5\">1 Ch 25:5</a> (v. Kau; > Be <em>blow loudly</em> [cf. <strong>1 c</strong>]), + <span dir=\"rtl\">לְעַמּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 148:14\" href=\"/Psalms.148.14\">ψ 148:14</a> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>); also haughtiness, arrogance <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:5\" href=\"/Psalms.75.5\">75:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:6\" href=\"/Psalms.75.6\">6</a>; opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּדַע ק׳</span> <em>hew off horns</em>, i.e. reduce, humiliate, <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.3\">La 2:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 75:11\" href=\"/Psalms.75.11\">ψ 75:11</a>, pass. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:25\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.25\">Je 48:25</a>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">וְעֹלַלתִּי בֶעָפָר קַרְנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 16:15\" href=\"/Job.16.15\">Jb 16:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַצְמִיחַ ק׳ לְבֵית יִשׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.21\">Ez 29:21</a> is appar. of restoration of might (as <a data-ref=\"Psalms 148:14\" href=\"/Psalms.148.14\">ψ 148:14</a> supr., c. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּרֶם</span>), but <span dir=\"rtl\">אַצ׳ ק׳ לְדָוִד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:17\" href=\"/Psalms.132.17\">ψ 132:17</a> of raising up individual ruler of Davidic line."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of altar, horn-like projections at corners (26 times), <a data-ref=\"Amos 3:14\" href=\"/Amos.3.14\">Am 3:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.1\">Je 17:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.15\">Ez 43:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.20\">20</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 118:27\" href=\"/Psalms.118.27\">ψ 118:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:2\" href=\"/Exodus.27.2\">Ex 27:2</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 8 times Ex, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.7\">Lv 4:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.18\">18</a> + 6 times Lv (all P); as sanctuary, refuge <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:50\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.50\">1 K 1:50</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:51\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.51\">51</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:28\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.28\">2:28</a>."}],"num":"3."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>hill</em> (so in Arabic, <em>peak, isolated hill</em>, cf. Ges) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.1\">Is 5:1</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"4."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנַיִם מִיָּדוֹ לוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:4\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.4\">Hb 3:4</a> <em>rays at his side</em>(<em>s</em>) <em>had he</em> (of lightning-flashes in theoph, cf. Now Da).—<a data-ref=\"Amos 6:13\" href=\"/Amos.6.13\">Am 6:13</a> v. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנַיִם</span> n.pr.loc."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"5."}]},"rid":"BDB08983","strong_numbers":["7161","7162"],"next_hw":"קָרַן","prev_hw":"קרן","occurrences":"75","quotes":[],"GK":["7967"],"TWOT":["2072a","2980"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}